{"unit_id":"tag:0D17:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一阶加厚（first order thickening）。设 <MATH_0004> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的平坦（flat）态射（morphism），在 <MATH_0005> 上。如果存在平坦（flat）态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，它是 <MATH_0007> 上代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射，以及同构（isomorphsm）<MATH_0008>（在 <MATH_0009> 上），则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对（pairs）<MATH_0010> 的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）在\n<MATH_0011>\n的作用下是主齐性的（principal homogeneous），并且\n<STRUCT_0003> 自同构（automorphisms）<MATH_0012> 的集合（set），其中自同构在 <MATH_0013> 上且在 <MATH_0014> 上约化为恒等映射（identity），就是 <MATH_0015>。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphsm","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous","target_term":"主齐性的"},{"source_term":"automorphisms","target_term":"自同构"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"加厚与态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶加厚","context":"给定加厚。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射性质。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"原态射及提升。"},{"source_term":"isomorphsm","target_term":"同构","context":"原文拼错的 isomorphism 术语。"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"对","